     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nDear all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nabstract submission is now open for the ISEC 2022, which will take place in hybrid format in wonderful Capetown next summer; see below.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<div bgcolor=\"#F6F6F6\" style=\"background:#f6f6f6\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/ORDcmmE4cDXKrTUC1upxeNujf7bKwFBE-cOLFNjayRsyGCP8_XQiKW-01GtkmDKoYrcTVdhpi3uPFfXr5lsyicyIv5bx3e2Gul4hPGXrayaMRQW4M4jG5_470Yljo0ETho9ChyBJTEQsRWqRCwnBq5hwk4d7YOW8OiX4r6DEsfN3b4T8xg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://live1.evread1.net/s/r/234972/1140878/317205736/1.gif?m=p3iqUBnkyUFcj2DC&amp;h=e842fda06ec7cbd5515fb2dcb2da97de\">\r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px;line-height:20px\" width=\"800\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"line-height:7px\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2F_3OvCVm2BQC3qnrysGaCFk&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7C1a3e1105f602493d0e3d08d990750cb5%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637699654660495390%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=9ze9XG5VeY%2FYW8YXeTTCxDzeQgha6hAqWTgyYvNCID4%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252F_3OvCVm2BQC3qnrysGaCFk%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.ch%257C1a3e1105f602493d0e3d08d990750cb5%257C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%257C1%257C0%257C637699654660495390%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C1000%26sdata%3D9ze9XG5VeY%252FYW8YXeTTCxDzeQgha6hAqWTgyYvNCID4%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493906742000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1fCrAHk0wxJHfPKE9puFRn\"><img alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"142\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/jm9OS9-Q74asFnLFIU4TlsR5vwiLURKBVGQA9U9bocO26FEOvqI0Hu95vQyio1R-X0_1y-nqW4dxMDqbRqxECHf7W8Vti7VH1z3duff7rpi9mUqiaqtkN8VcsizW9w=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/Isec_logo.jpg\"></a><br>\r\n<img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:431px;width:800px\" width=\"800\" height=\"431\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/cAkCVcA7K8rcTd1hpS9ovaHno6Dh0Ow4gLdamLB7xRfVulX2sIEyTLJvVLwC_NfTcVZkiuvML5Kn0uUuuTMebS9yRUuEBqfhdcYCVv465Dp3RFpgHwAyof0fbqc33uZjkutdoprB=s0-d-e1-ft#https://cdn1.mailercdn.net/users/assets/304/images/ChrisOosthuizen_ISEC_(4)-sig.jpg\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#445950\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"740\" bgcolor=\"#445950\" align=\"center\">\r\n<h2 style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:26px;margin:0\">CALL FOR ABSTRACTS<br>\r\n<span style=\"color:#eabf13;font-size:14px\">Deadline for submission of abstracts: 9 December 2021</span></h2>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"30\" bgcolor=\"#445950\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:80px;width:30px\" width=\"30\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/EUzVBTU-VeJeyKEgsNbru-JrB7croZ1nsJ6r_oT-z-URwK95ZNZ-s7mJN4_SF6zItpjRCuXIhwNgIeqTkFNhStOLPFhO2ul52ya26I8xUoCAUGdoWVaq_CLH4g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/spacer.png\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\" height=\"30\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"740\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe ISEC 2022 Conference will showcase the latest works and interesting research findings of various statistical ecology related issues world-wide. The conference will be run in hybrid format and we are inviting abstracts for presentations to be delivered either\r\n in person or online.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAbstracts may be submitted online for Oral or Poster presentations and should be limited to 350 words. Your submission will be double-blind reviewed. A good abstract will address the following points:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Is it suitable for a conference at the interface between statistics and ecology, and related disciplines? (Relevance)</li><li>Is it addressing an important problem? (Significance)</li><li>New statistical methods for ecology? Or new insights in ecology from modern statistical methods? (Innovation)</li><li>Can it be read and understood by a non-specialist? (Accessibility)</li></ul>\r\nPlease keep these criteria in mind when putting together your title/abstract.<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Abstracts may be submitted in the following categories:</b><br>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"360\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Abundance estimation</li><li>Biodiversity</li><li>Capture-recapture</li><li>Citizen science and big data</li><li>Community dynamics</li><li>Conservation, management and decision analysis</li><li>Data integration</li><li>Disease ecology</li><li>Distance sampling</li><li>Evolutionary ecology</li><li>Fisheries management</li><li>Genetics and eDNA</li><li>Metapopulation dynamics</li></ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"20\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/EUzVBTU-VeJeyKEgsNbru-JrB7croZ1nsJ6r_oT-z-URwK95ZNZ-s7mJN4_SF6zItpjRCuXIhwNgIeqTkFNhStOLPFhO2ul52ya26I8xUoCAUGdoWVaq_CLH4g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/spacer.png\"></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Movement ecology, space use and habitat selection</li><li>Multi-species modelling</li><li>Occupancy modelling</li><li>Population dynamics</li><li>Sampling</li><li>Software developments</li><li>Spatial modelling</li><li>Species distribution modelling</li><li>Statistical theory</li><li>Survey design</li><li>Other fields within the Statistical Ecology theme</li></ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"220\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2FscVBCWnKDqiOrL7qsx2BIQ&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7C1a3e1105f602493d0e3d08d990750cb5%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637699654660505344%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=93cDCiIyR6AwJq1Hv%2Fxd2Jlu1g%2BbjgsA6ky%2FhakGD8M%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252FscVBCWnKDqiOrL7qsx2BIQ%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.ch%257C1a3e1105f602493d0e3d08d990750cb5%257C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%257C1%257C0%257C637699654660505344%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C1000%26sdata%3D93cDCiIyR6AwJq1Hv%252Fxd2Jlu1g%252BbjgsA6ky%252FhakGD8M%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792493906743000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2udUBb65P2xzLRYla5ye-X\">Submit\r\n abstracts</a></td>\r\n<td width=\"220\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"min-height:30px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"30\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/EUzVBTU-VeJeyKEgsNbru-JrB7croZ1nsJ6r_oT-z-URwK95ZNZ-s7mJN4_SF6zItpjRCuXIhwNgIeqTkFNhStOLPFhO2ul52ya26I8xUoCAUGdoWVaq_CLH4g=s0-d-e1-ft#https://d2y0ltxfpojlex.cloudfront.net/users/assets/304/images/spacer.png\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"30\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"30\"><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"740\" align=\"center\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>Res Altwegg</b> <i>(Co-Chair Local Organising Committee and Scientific Planning Committee)</i><br>\r\n<b>Greg Distiller</b> <i>(Co-Chair Local Organising Committee)</i><br>\r\n<b>David Warton</b> <i>(Co-Chair Scientific Planning Committee)</i><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>WORKSHOPS, ROUND TABLE DISCUSSIONS, SIDE MEETINGS AND SKILLS SHOWCASES:</b><br>\r\n<br>\r\nApplications are still open. Click on the relevant button below to submit your application:<br>\r\n \r\n<table style=\"font-family:Arial,&#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size:16px\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"230\" bgcolor=\"#BF9000\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%2Fs%2F-BLiCX6XE5t2EPvKUDV15Q&amp;data=04%...%40vogelwarte.ch%7C1a3e1105f602493d0e3d08d990750cb5%7C251ae8d19a904569a35b9d2bc41188d2%7C1%7C0%7C637699654660505344%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C1000&amp;sdata=MiqoPLdbZ%2Fk5KfpQDBTHc%2FWfahB13V9T3sqo%2BvY%2F9XI%3D&amp;reserved=0\" style=\"color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://che01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fprotect-za.mimecast.com%252Fs%252F-BLiCX6XE5t2EPvKUDV15Q%26data%3D04%257C01%257Cmarc.kery%2540vogelwarte.